=== APPLICATION: REGULAR (H-max/Paley) score-sequence census in the tiling model ===
  n=3: # tilings with regular score seq (all s_v=1) = 1
  n=5: # tilings with regular score seq (all s_v=2) = 3
  n=7: # tilings with regular score seq (all s_v=3) = 91
